{"id": "hk-nobel-08-hassabis-illustrated-v1-mandarin", "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z", "stage": {"id": "hk-nobel-08-hassabis-illustrated-v1-mandarin", "name": "諾貝爾科學故事 08：哈薩比斯與蛋白質預測（普通話）", "description": "從遊戲到生命科學，認識人工智能如何幫助研究蛋白質，與日常生活有甚麼關係。", "languageDirective": "使用香港繁體中文，以普通話向初中學生講授。明確區分計算預測、實驗證據和仍待驗證的應用；不提供醫療建議。", "createdAt": 1793793600000, "updatedAt": 1793793600000, "style": "slide", "generatedAgentConfigs": [{"id": "nobel08-teacher", "name": "科學故事老師", "role": "teacher", "persona": "我用香港生活例子講解蛋白質結構預測及其價值，說明類比限制，不把研究前景說成已有療效。", "avatar": "/avatars/teacher.png", "color": "#24665f", "priority": 10}, {"id": "nobel08-assistant", "name": "科學小助手", "role": "assistant", "persona": "我幫學生區分計算模型、實驗證據和研究前景，尊重不確定性，不提供個人診療。", "avatar": "/avatars/assist.png", "color": "#2563eb", "priority": 7}, {"id": "nobel08-student", "name": "好奇同學", "role": "student", "persona": "我是AI同學，喜歡提出簡短問題，幫助大家思考如何檢查證據。", "avatar": "/avatars/curious.png", "color": "#bf9949", "priority": 5}]}, "scenes": [{"id": "nobel08-slide-07", "stageId": "hk-nobel-08-hassabis-illustrated-v1-mandarin", "title": "怎樣知道預測不是瞎猜？", "order": 7, "outlineId": "nobel08-slide-07-outline", "createdAt": 1793793600000, "updatedAt": 1793793600000, "type": "slide", "actions": [{"id": "nobel08-slide-07-focus", "type": "spotlight", "elementId": "nobel08-slide-07-key"}, {"id": "nobel08-slide-07-speech", "type": "speech", "text": "在一次重要評估中，研究者先提交預測，再與尚未公開的實驗結構比較。這就像先交答案，再揭開核對依據，能幫助我們判斷方法有沒有真正的本領。2020年，AlphaFold2在這樣的評估中取得重要進展。請看資料圖：預測與實驗得到的結構模型可以作比較。這一個例子不能代表每一次都同樣準確；科學判斷需要看更多評估和不確定的地方。", "audioId": "/api/classroom-media/hk-nobel-08-hassabis-illustrated-v1-mandarin/audio/zh-CN/page-07.mp3", "audioUrl": "/api/classroom-media/hk-nobel-08-hassabis-illustrated-v1-mandarin/audio/zh-CN/page-07.mp3"}], "content": {"type": "slide", "canvas": {"id": "nobel08-slide-07-canvas", "viewportSize": 1000, "viewportRatio": 0.5625, "theme": {"backgroundColor": "#f6f1e6", "themeColors": ["#24665f", "#bf9949", "#102b38"], "fontColor": "#102b38", 